# NO FOOTER FROM THE RUNNER, AND WHY. All 30 launches completed and every one of
# them is above. The runner's closing block (loadavg, date, "# done") is missing
# because scripts/run_launches.sh was edited on disk while this sweep was still
# executing it -- bash reads a script incrementally, so the rewrite landed in the
# middle of a line it had not reached yet and the shell aborted with a syntax
# error after the last launch had already been written. Nothing about the
# measurements is affected; the edit was to a comment block. Recorded here rather
# than re-run, because re-running would replace an honest sweep with a tidier one.
